--- !u!114 &1592322735
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1592322730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3bf035807a7a55240a5193535a38d554, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 404311552}
  lines:
  - Have you ever seen everything fall into the right place
  - Only for someone to take it all away?
  - Who's gonna remember my music?
  - What, my family? My friends?
  - Yes, I remember, he was such a talented young man.
  - It's a shame what happened to him.
  - I don't have friends. My family doesn't speak to me.
  - I gave them up for my one chance.
  - I was gonna be something
  - Now I'm nothing
  - Just like everyone else on this train...
